# The Shift-click in the main menu's top right corner that starts the ant
# missions, the mission restated in a message box (there is no briefing
# movie), and the first ant mission.
at 300 keydown SHIFT
at 301 click 580 50
at 305 keyup SHIFT
at 340 shot difficulty
at 341 key RETURN
at 600 shot briefing
at 601 key RETURN
at 900 shot mission_start
at 901 quit
